From: Aerium Lumen BSP <bsp@aerium.co.il>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] arm64: dts: nvidia: p3767: fix CSI port-index and serial_a

The Lumen carrier connects the MIPI CSI camera to port A (serial_a)
on CSI index 0, not port B / index 1 as on the NVIDIA reference devkit.

Changes:
  - port-index: 0x01 -> 0x00
  - tegra_sinterface: "serial_b" -> "serial_a"

Applies to tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-*.dts and camera DTBO overlays.

Derived from Aerium-Lumen-BSP-Orin-NX-Nano.sh (CSI fix + camera DTBO section).

NOTE: This patch must be applied against the L4T kernel source tree.
      The exact context lines below are representative — replace with
      real hunks once you have the L4T source:
        scripts/bsp/Aerium-Lumen-BSP-Orin-NX-Nano.sh  (reference logic)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000.dts
@@ -1,0 +1,0 @@
-			port-index = <0x01>;
-			tegra_sinterface = "serial_b";
+			port-index = <0x00>;
+			tegra_sinterface = "serial_a";
